    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Perfectly positioned on Pier Road, just off Schull's Main Street, No. 2 is an ideal retreat in the heart of one of West Cork's most sought-after villages. With the harbour and pier and picturesque swimming spots just moments from the front door, the location is second to none.\r\n\r\nRecently renovated to a high standard, this charming two-bedroom home is presented in excellent condition and is ready for immediate occupation.\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out, with a bright open-plan sitting and dining room creating a welcoming living space. A well-appointed kitchen, together with a guest WC incorporating a washer and dryer, completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two bedrooms comprising a generous principal bedroom with fitted wardrobe and a second bunk room, ideal for children or visiting guests. A modern family shower room completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nWhile on-street parking is available, the property also benefits from the convenience of a large public car park located less than 50 metres away.\r\nWith cafés, restaurants, independent shops, the harbour and coastal walks all within easy walking distance, No. 2 offers the very best of village and seaside living in the heart of Schull.\r\n\r\nNote: The BER was completed prior to the renovations taking place. The property now has an Air Source Heat Pump, all new electrics and water tank etc\r\n\r\nProperty layout: \r\nLiving / dining room: (4.7m x 3.7m) open fire \r\nKitchen: (1.8m x 3.2m)\r\nBathroom: (1.6m x 1.5m) WC, WHB \r\n\r\n1st floor: \r\nBedroom 1: (4.7m x 3m) built in wardrobes \r\nBedroom 2: (1.8m x 1.8m) built in bunk beds \r\nBathroom: (1.7m x 1.6m) WC, WHB, Shower. \r\n\r\nAdditional info: \r\nHeating: Air source heat pump along with open fire \r\nServices: Mains water and sewage \r\nPVC windows \r\nRear garden"
      },
